l8p_drafts: Layer 8 record l8p, W4DP-F2's breaker, its make-last dock enable loop and its restart inhibit drafted for boards P, E and A (MESHSAT-1357)
prototype design; nothing built, bought or measured; nothing applied to the tree; the values are record l9stk's (fnd/l9stk at 0d72880b)

